Upstream tools
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The upstream tools this project runs (Conftest, OPA, score-k8s, score-compose,
kube-linter, Trivy, OpenTofu, agg) are fetched at their pinned upstream versions
by ./bin/setup.sh and retain their own licenses — Apache-2.0 in every case
except OpenTofu, which is MPL-2.0. Nothing from those projects is vendored into
this repository.

  Conftest        Apache-2.0   https://github.com/open-policy-agent/conftest
  OPA             Apache-2.0   https://github.com/open-policy-agent/opa
  score-k8s       Apache-2.0   https://github.com/score-spec/score-k8s
  score-compose   Apache-2.0   https://github.com/score-spec/score-compose
  kube-linter     Apache-2.0   https://github.com/stackrox/kube-linter
  Trivy           Apache-2.0   https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy
  OpenTofu        MPL-2.0      https://github.com/opentofu/opentofu
  agg             Apache-2.0   https://github.com/asciinema/agg

